td><td>Poverty</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"/2026/10/29/only-30-of-secondary-teachers-trained-in-health-education-study-finds/\">Situation Analysis Report on the Health Promoting Schools Programme</a></td><td>DSHE, Ministry of Education, with UNESCO</td><td>Jul 2026</td><td>Education, health</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"/2026/10/29/new-atlantic-council-brief-examines-bangladeshs-changing-aid-landscape/\">Bangladesh&#8217;s changing development assistance landscape</a></td><td>Atlantic Council</td><td>26 Oct 2026</td><td>Aid financing</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"/2026/10/29/unesco-assessment-sets-out-15-recommendations-on-ai-readiness-in-bangladesh/\">Bangladesh: Artificial Intelligence Readiness Assessment Report</a></td><td>UNESCO, ICT Division, a2i, UNDP</td><td>14 Oct 2026</td><td>Digital development</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"/2026/11/10/world-bank-half-of-poorest-households-get-no-safety-net/\">Bangladesh Development Update: Make Subsidies and Social Protection Work Better for the Poor</a></td><td>World Bank</td><td>6 Oct 2026</td><td>Poverty, social protection</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">How we cover research</h2>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Every summary names the authors or institution, publication date, geography and method where relevant.</li>\n\n\n<li>We note material limitations and avoid treating one study as proof of a wider trend.</li>\n\n\n<li>We always link to the original report.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Coming next: a searchable repository by theme, organisation, year and geography. <a href=\"/submit/\">Submit research</a> · <a href=\"/category/research/\">All research</a></p>\n\n\n",
